OL,3,GNEWSAProperty firm told to repay       
OL,4,Acustomers thousands over 'unfair' sales
OL,5,Atactics                                
OL,7,FA property sales company has to pay    
OL,8,Fback more than #277,000 to customers   
OL,9,Facross the UK after a watchdog found it
OL,10,Fhad treated buyers unfairly by         
OL,11,Fmisrepresenting rental incomes.        
OL,13,FLet Property is facing "unprecedented" 
OL,14,Flevels of repayments after the UK      
OL,15,FProperty Ombudsman received nearly 200 
OL,16,Fcomplaints.                            
