OL,3,GNEWSAProperty firm told to repay       
OL,4,Acustomers thousands over 'unfair' sales
OL,5,Atactics                                
OL,7,FCustomers paid the company upfront fees
OL,8,Fof about #3,000 each to reserve        
OL,9,Fbuy-to-let properties - but deals later
OL,10,Ffell through after valuations and      
OL,11,Frental income projections were found to
OL,12,Fbe misleading.                         
OL,14,FGlasgow-based Let Property said        
OL,15,Fcustomers had "experienced             
OL,16,Fdifficulties" during transactions in   
OL,17,FEngland, but it remained committed to  
OL,18,Fimproving its service and treating     
OL,19,Fcustomers fairly.                      
